ason: Checking is the safest and most logical play. It allows you to see the Turn card for free, potentially improving your hand (e.g., hitting a Queen or a 2), without risking any additional chips. Since the opponent showed weakness by checking, there is no immediate threat, and keeping the pot small is advantageous with a marginal hand like Q-high.\n\nAnswer: 0'}
